 ".",
 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"3bbe2fab-d5d6-4efd-a26c-dd07ca3ab6d8"],

Cell["\<\
A structure of this paclet is a tagged object, not a bare Association, so \
that it can be recognized, dispatched on and printed as itself. The predicate \
answers the recognition question only: it does not check that the data inside \
is consistent.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ac58fe9b-ef66-4077-870c-d63705aa50d9"],

Cell["\<\
Every operation accepts the tagged object and unwraps it, so the predicate is \
never needed to call anything. It is for the caller writing their own \
definitions.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"7f4e5f47-18b1-4cf4-99fa-540a9920c646"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "It is the recognition question, not the axiom: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["AInfinityQ"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/AInfinityQ", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "d614741b-3edf-4f4b-8e77-127ba361af9f"],
 " asks whether the relations hold."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"6a25a643-7fc5-4799-af12-4e8e06a32e64"]
}, Open  ]],

